{"id":"steam-813860","steam":813860,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"N.U.T.Z.","summary":"N.U.T.Z. is a stylized non-linear platform game that incorporates elements of a shooting platformer, and is inspired by classics such as Megaman and Metroid.  Collect weapons and shields as you blast your way through the Saurian horde invading the world of Zarda.","about":"Note: We decided to release this last version of NUTZ as a way to preserve the title that started our journey. Since we are moving in a substantially different direction with the game we decided to give away this version of the game for free. We will not be providing any additional support for this game going forward and thank you for your understanding!\n\nN.U.T.Z. is a stylized non-linear platform game that incorporates elements of a shooting platformer, and is inspired by classics such as Megaman and Metroid.  \n\nThe player controls a single character on screen that can carry a variety of different weapons and can freely aim and attack in a 360 radius. We currently support both mouse-keyboard and gamepad-controller setups. \n\nCollect weapons and shields as you blast your way through the Saurian horde invading the world of Zarda. Each character has a unique set of abilities that differentiate their playstyle from each other. Saya's cuts down enemies with her sword skills while Sil shoots them up with her arsenal of weapons.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813860/portrait.png?t=1776733921","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813860/header.jpg?t=1776733921","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813860/header.jpg?t=1776733921","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813860/ss_811d5622ec346f0b4cc4fff8e82c1c19dcacb217.600x338.jpg?t=1776733921","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i